  "name": "10.2 (2) Routing : Agentic Framework",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Routing\n\n☑️ Optimized Response Handling - Ensures the right AI agent processes the query instead of a single generalist AI.\n\n☑️ Scalable & Modular - New AI agents can be added to handle additional topics.\n\n☑️ Faster & More Efficient - Reduces unnecessary LLM calls and improves response speed.\n\n☑️ Human Escalation for Critical Issues - Ensures urgent problems are handled by real support staff.\n\n☑️ Better User Experience - More accurate and relevant responses tailored to the customer’s needs.\n",
        "height": 272,
        "width": 800,
        "color": 5
      },
